. * nwrem tutorial 1: a first relational event model on an email log
. * Requires the core nwcommands and the package nwrem.
. * The data (Michalski 2020, CC0) are loaded from the nwcommands website.
. 
. nwrem version
nwrem version 1.1.2, 13nov2026
  core package nwcommands : installed (development copy, no distribution date)
  native plugin           : none (Mata only)
  compared with           : R relevent 1.2-1
  license                 : GNU GPL-3

. 
. * --- the event data: one row per email, with the time it was sent (days since 1
>  January 2010) ---
. nwwebuse manufacturing, nwclear
(plain Stata dataset loaded - not a saved network file; build a network from it
directly, e.g. with nwfromedge or nwgenerate)

. list in 1/5

     +------------------------------+
     | sender   receiver          t |
     |------------------------------|
  1. |    E39        E81   3.235255 |
  2. |    E39        E81   3.235822 |
  3. |   E112       E136    3.25566 |
  4. |   E112        E60    3.25728 |
  5. |   E112        E57   3.257963 |
     +------------------------------+

. count
  50,233

. 
. * --- a short window: the emails of the first five days of the data ---
. * All 144 employees could have sent or received an email, but fewer appear in th
> e window.
. * The others are still possible senders and receivers, so we add them as isolate
> s.
